<script setup lang="ts">defineProps<{trace:any;states:string[]}>();const allowedAt=(trace:any,step:number)=>{const mark=(trace.constraints||[]).find((c:any)=>c.step===step);return mark?mark.allowed_states:null};</script><template><div class="constraint-strip" v-if="trace.constraints?.length"><small>隐态假设标记</small><span v-for="(token,i) in trace.tokens" :key="i" :class="['constraint-cell',{'has-mark':allowedAt(trace,Number(i)+1)}]"><template v-if="allowedAt(trace,Number(i)+1)"><b>{{Number(i)+1}}</b>{{allowedAt(trace,Number(i)+1).join('/')}}</template><template v-else>·</template></span></div><p v-else-if="trace.constraint_mode==='unconstrained'" class="constraint-none">本条未标记隐态假设，按无约束路径读取；旧数据升级后同样保持无约束结果。</p><p v-else-if="trace.constraint_status==='conflict'" class="copper">标记与固定模型/观测冲突：首个无可行路径的是第{{trace.constraint_conflict.first_infeasible_step}}步（{{trace.constraint_conflict.stage==='model'?'模型层面':'观测层面'}}）。真实0，不是数值下溢。</p></template>
